# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# The app is built and tested on Linux (GitHub Actions, Cloudflare Workers
# Builds), and many tests read source and SQL files and match their text.
# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true by default) checks files
# out with CRLF and those tests fail locally although the code is unchanged.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
